# Build context for docker/dev/Dockerfile is the REPO ROOT, because the three
# requirements files it installs live in three different subtrees. Deny everything,
# then re-admit only those files. This keeps migration_backup/ (7.1 GB), .venv/,
# airflow/logs/, spark/ml/data/, google-cloud-sdk/, dbt_packages/ and secrets/ out
# of the daemon upload entirely — a build should transfer kilobytes, not gigabytes.
#
# Everything the container actually uses arrives through the bind mount at runtime,
# not through COPY, so nothing here restricts what the container can see.
#
# This file does NOT affect the Airflow image: that build's context is airflow/.
*
!docker/dev/requirements-dev.txt
!dbt/requirements.txt
!spark/ml/requirements.txt
